 "description": "<p>Red body, ten vibration frequencies, ten sucking frequencies — the spec sheet for this rose reads symmetric, and the symmetry carries into use. Vibration runs one channel, suction the other, and pairing a low note from each produces a steadier feel than cranking either bank to its top.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_6_093e9f79-1a38-4e7c-8625-2a6b511932ec_480x480.jpg?v=1691572566\"></p>\n<p>ABS and silicone share the construction in the usual division: rigid where the motors need anchoring, soft everywhere skin meets surface. The red finish is the saturated kind — the color of the category, applied properly.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_5_d8ae44c3-ec55-43c9-8866-72bc3e7fee5a_480x480.jpg?v=1691572563\"></p>\n<p>Below 40 decibels, both channels stay quieter than a whispered conversation, which reclassifies the toy from special-occasion to any-occasion. Power arrives over USB with a magnetic charger in the box, so there is no port to cover and no cable polarity to respect.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_b8c5575a-2271-4fb9-bf73-5479026ac790_480x480.jpg?v=1691572554\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vibration modes: 10</li>\n<li>Sucking modes: 10</li>\n<li>Material: ABS + silicone</li>\n<li>Noise: under 40 dB</li>\n<li>Charging: USB with magnetic charger</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_1_8c62ebd9-d208-421f-918c-d4509463039d_480x480.jpg?v=1691572547\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_3_8950056c-9c31-47ba-83e4-74eb23282e3c_480x480.jpg?v=1691572558\"></p>\n<p>Two tens and a quiet motor — the balanced build, in category-red.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Red rose toy with 10 vibration and 10 sucking frequencies under 40 dB, USB magnetic charging and a silicone-over-ABS build.</p>\n",
